OpenEmbedded guest image

This package contains a guest disk image, and its kernel, built from
OpenEmbedded recipes in another multiconfig of the same build. The image is
an aggregate of separately licensed software packages. It is not covered
by a single license.

- The license of each package in the image is listed in the license
  manifest at /usr/share/common-licenses/license.manifest inside the
  image (COPY_LIC_MANIFEST = "1" in the guest multiconfig).
- The same manifest and the full license texts are in the guest build's
  ${DEPLOY_DIR}/licenses/ directory.
